<title>UK: Kellogg prices $500 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kellogg prices $500 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Goldman Sachs Intl, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KELLOGG CO</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    29.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.245   PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.67     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  1.70	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
